        "text": "=You are an autonomous business development and lead intelligence agent.\n\nAnalyze this live submission:\n- Title: {{ $json.title }}\n- URL: {{ $json.url || 'No external URL' }}\n- Text / Body: {{ $json.text || 'No description provided' }}\n\nEvaluate whether this post represents a high-intent opportunity (e.g., a company hiring engineers, an organization looking for AI solutions, or a founder facing technical roadblocks).\n\nReturn your response strictly in the following JSON format:\n{\n  \"score\": <number from 1 to 10>,\n  \"reasoning\": \"<1 sentence explaining why this score was given>\",\n  \"draft_reply\": \"<a 2-3 sentence value-first, non-salesy response or outreach angle tailored to their specific problem>\",\n  \"post_title\": \"{{ $json.title }}\",\n  \"post_url\": \"{{ $json.url || 'https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=' + $json.id }}\"\n}\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON.",
        "options": {}
      },
